T1  - Deep learning-based clustering for endotyping and post-arthroplasty response classification using knee osteoarthritis multiomic data.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.ard.2025.01.012
A1  - Rockel, Jason S
A1  - Sharma, Divya
A1  - Espin-Garcia, Osvaldo
A1  - Hueniken, Katrina
A1  - Sandhu, Amit
A1  - Pastrello, Chiara
A1  - Sundararajan, Kala
A1  - Potla, Pratibha
A1  - Fine, Noah
A1  - Lively, Starlee S
A1  - Perry, Kim
