T1  - Correlation between Harris hip score and gait analysis through artificial intelligence pose estimation in patients after total hip arthroplasty.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.asjsur.2023.05.107
A1  - Lee, Sang Yeob
A1  - Park, Seong Jin
A1  - Gim, Jeong-An
