T1  - Medium-Term Outcomes of Digital Versus Conventional Home-Based Rehabilitation After Total Knee Arthroplasty: Prospective, Parallel-Group Feasibility Study.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.2196/13111
A1  - Correia, Fernando Dias
A1  - Nogueira, Andre
A1  - Magalhaes, Ivo
A1  - Guimaraes, Joana
A1  - Moreira, Maria
A1  - Barradas, Isabel
A1  - Molinos, Maria
